From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 07:28:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wbemprox: Add Windows XP's root\SecurityCenter, which Windows
 11 still has.

Its AntiVirusProduct, AntiSpywareProduct and FirewallProduct classes have
the properties and CIM types Windows 11 gives them, and no instances there;
a query for them succeeded on Windows and failed on Wine for want of the
namespace.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

